# Person-first: one screen of people, one screen per person.
screen Home
  top
    inbox
  middle
    me: identity, person
    list Contacts: everyone; shows knows, friend; opens Person
  bottom
    Establish
    Acquaint: Bob = typed

screen Person(p)
  middle
    p: knows, friend
  bottom
    Befriend: Bob = p
    Unfriend: Bob = p
    Introduce: Bob = p, Carol = pick everyone
    Introduce: Carol = p, Bob = pick everyone
